  "instructions": [
    "Season the lamb with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat oil in a large tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Brown the lamb on all sides, then remove and set aside.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger to the pot and cook until softened.",
    "Add cumin, coriander, and cinnamon; cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add apricots, pine nuts, and browned lamb to the pot.",
